Subject: [PATCH] Retain each live preset's texture lookup across pack switches

Port historical ProjectM-TV patch 0050 from main dd59a791 to upstream
6f64807467e312034883a4389e6aa80a675458bc after compatibility patches 0001-0009.
Retain per-preset texture managers through soft cuts and reset each live user
image cache without redirecting lookups or resetting authored feedback. Preserve
4.2 shader-cache ownership, explicit transition time and texture-load callback.
Original local implementation and attribution: ProjectM-TV PR #50.

